  "description": "Ji-Yu, who has only ever been 1st in the whole school, receives an unimaginable grade of 2nd place after entering high school. Shocked, Ji-Yu hears that dating will cause grades to drop, so he confesses to Do-Hyeon, the top student in the whole school, in order to regain his position as 1st. But what…? Why are you accepting my confession…? \n\nWill Ji-Yu be able to successfully persuade Do-Hyeon and regain his position as 1st in the whole school!?\n\n(Source: Ridibooks, translated)",
